menu "C6 check"
    config C6_CHECK_OTA
        bool "Update the C6 (ESP-Hosted OTA) from the image in the partition c6fw"
        default n
        help
            Reads an ESP32-C6 ESP-Hosted image from the partition c6fw
            (dash/partitions.csv, written with parttool.py) and sends it to the
            C6 over SDIO. Skipped if the C6 already runs that version.
endmenu
